# Runtime data files (user-specific)
# Leading slash anchors these to the repo root: in dev the data directory
# defaults to the CWD, so only the top-level archive/ is user data. An unanchored
# "archive/" also matched electron/services/import/archive/ and silently kept
# source files out of commits.
/settings.json
/threads.json
/archive/
.history